<main id="top">
  <section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">For the families who can't be there every day</p>
      <h1 class="reveal d1">A daily call to keep the ones you love <span class="it">company</span>.<span class="sub">And a note for you after each call.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead reveal d2">A warm voice calls their usual phone, talks with patience, and afterward tells you how they are. No apps, no gadgets, nothing new for them to learn. Unlike an emergency button, it does not wait for something to go wrong.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions reveal d2">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#early">Request early access
          <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#pillars">See what it covers</a>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-row reveal d3">
        <span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Works on any phone</span>
        <span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Private by default</span>
        <span><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Cancel any time</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hd-wrap reveal d1">
      <div class="hd-card">
        <figure class="hd-photo">
          <img src="mari.jpg" alt="Mari, an older woman, smiling on the phone">
          <span class="hd-live"><i></i> Real call · shared with consent</span>
          <span class="hd-grad"></span>
          <span class="hd-who"><b>Mari</b><span>answered today's call</span></span>
        </figure>
        <div class="hd-rhead"><div><h3>How Mom's doing</h3><p>What Elderly noticed during the chat.</p></div><span class="hd-hint"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg> tap to listen</span></div>
        <div class="hd-body">
          <div class="hd-sec hd-s-seg">
            <div class="hd-sechead"><span class="hd-dot"></span><span class="hd-secname">Her safety</span><span class="hd-count">1 signal</span></div>
            <p class="hd-intro">The safe word, working in real life. Scams and finances are on the roadmap, not promised yet.</p>
            <div class="hd-clip" data-audio="en1"><button class="hd-cbtn" aria-label="Play"><svg class="hd-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg><svg class="hd-pause" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M7 5h4v14H7zM13 5h4v14h-4z"/></svg></button><div class="hd-cmid"><div class="hd-ctitle">The safe word</div><div class="hd-cq">“The keyword is sunflower, so you know you can trust me.”</div><div class="hd-prog"><i></i></div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hd-sec hd-s-men">
            <div class="hd-sechead"><span class="hd-dot"></span><span class="hd-secname">Her mind and mood</span><span class="hd-count">3 moments</span></div>
            <div class="hd-clip" data-audio="en6"><button class="hd-cbtn" aria-label="Play"><svg class="hd-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg><svg class="hd-pause" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M7 5h4v14H7zM13 5h4v14h-4z"/></svg></button><div class="hd-cmid"><div class="hd-ctitle">Recounting the novel</div><div class="hd-cq">She recalled the entire plot of a World War II book.</div><div class="hd-prog"><i></i></div></div></div>
            <div class="hd-clip" data-audio="en4"><button class="hd-cbtn" aria-label="Play"><svg class="hd-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg><svg class="hd-pause" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M7 5h4v14H7zM13 5h4v14h-4z"/></svg></button><div class="hd-cmid"><div class="hd-ctitle">Alone, but not lonely</div><div class="hd-cq">“I thought I’d stopped existing for them, but he still visits me.”</div><div class="hd-prog"><i></i></div></div></div>
            <div class="hd-clip" data-audio="en3"><button class="hd-cbtn" aria-label="Play"><svg class="hd-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg><svg class="hd-pause" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M7 5h4v14H7zM13 5h4v14h-4z"/></svg></button><div class="hd-cmid"><div class="hd-ctitle">Her grandson</div><div class="hd-cq">“Grandma, I’m going to miss you so much.”</div><div class="hd-prog"><i></i></div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hd-sec hd-s-cue">
            <div class="hd-sechead"><span class="hd-dot"></span><span class="hd-secname">Her body and routine</span><span class="hd-count">1 signal</span></div>
            <div class="hd-clip" data-audio="en5"><button class="hd-cbtn" aria-label="Play"><svg class="hd-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg><svg class="hd-pause" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M7 5h4v14H7zM13 5h4v14h-4z"/></svg></button><div class="hd-cmid"><div class="hd-ctitle">A rough night</div><div class="hd-cq">“Not great, I don’t know why.” Caught the same day.</div><div class="hd-prog"><i></i></div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hd-sec hd-s-his">
            <div class="hd-sechead"><span class="hd-dot"></span><span class="hd-secname">Stories of the week</span><span class="hd-count">1 story</span></div>
            <p class="hd-intro">Moments to share with the family. Saved in her own voice.</p>
            <div class="hd-clip" data-audio="en2"><button class="hd-cbtn" aria-label="Play"><svg class="hd-play" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg><svg class="hd-pause" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M7 5h4v14H7zM13 5h4v14h-4z"/></svg></button><div class="hd-cmid"><div class="hd-ctitle">The glue stick</div><div class="hd-cq">She searched for an hour, and had it stuck on her the whole time. “I was wearing it!”</div><div class="hd-prog"><i></i></div></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hd-foot"><button id="hddl"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M12 3v12M7 11l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M5 21h14"/></svg> Download report</button></div>
        <audio id="en1" preload="none" src="audio/en1.mp3"></audio>
        <audio id="en2" preload="none" src="audio/en2.mp3"></audio>
        <audio id="en3" preload="none" src="audio/en3.mp3"></audio>
        <audio id="en4" preload="none" src="audio/en4.mp3"></audio>
        <audio id="en5" preload="none" src="audio/en5.mp3"></audio>
        <audio id="en6" preload="none" src="audio/en6.mp3"></audio>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section id="how"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Nothing to set up on their end.</h2><p>Most tools ask the wrong person to learn something new. Elderly asks the person you love only to pick up the phone. The caller is an AI voice assistant, and it says so up front.</p></div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal"><div class="n">01</div><h3>You tell us about them</h3><p>A few minutes: their name, the best time to call, and the things they love to talk about. The setup is on you, never on them.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal d1"><div class="n">02</div><h3>The phone rings</h3><p>At the times you choose, Elderly calls their regular landline or cell. No app, no gadget, no Wi Fi.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal d2"><div class="n">03</div><h3>They just talk</h3><p>A warm voice keeps them company, checks how they are doing, gently nudges good habits, and listens to their stories.</p></div>
      <div class="step reveal d3"><div class="n">04</div><h3>You stay in the loop</h3><p>Open the family app for a plain note after each call. How they sounded, and anything worth your attention.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>


  <section class="stats"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sh reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Why it matters</p><h2>Three quiet things every loving family watches for. Now you can watch over all three.</h2></div>
    <div class="stat-row">
      <div class="stat reveal"><div class="big"><span class="count" data-to="50">0</span><span class="accent">%</span></div><div class="txt">higher risk of dementia for older adults who are socially isolated, plus a nearly 30% higher risk of early death. Connection protects them.</div><div class="src">U.S. Surgeon General, 2023</div></div>
      <div class="stat reveal d1"><div class="big"><span class="accent">$</span><span class="count" data-to="4.9" data-dec="1">0</span><span class="accent">B</span></div><div class="txt">lost to online fraud by Americans over 60 in 2024, up 55% in a single year, with tech-support scams among the most common.</div><div class="src">FBI IC3, via America&#8217;s Health Rankings 2026</div></div>
      <div class="stat reveal d2"><div class="big"><span class="count" data-to="63">0</span><span class="accent">M</span></div><div class="txt">Americans care for an aging parent. 71% wish they could do more, most while working and raising kids of their own. You are not alone, and you do not have to do it all alone.</div><div class="src">AARP and Care.com, 2025</div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section id="pillars"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">What Elderly covers</p><h2>One call. Their whole wellbeing.</h2><p>Most services do one thing. Elderly brings prevention, education, and connection together.</p></div>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar body reveal">
        <div class="ic"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 7.6-7 9-4-1.4-7-4.5-7-9V6z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></div>
        <span class="tag">Prevention</span><h3>Catching what matters, early</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Gentle daily check-ins on sleep, meals, and mood</li>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> A same day note to you if something sounds off</li>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Scam early warning, and a family safe word against cloned voices</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar mind reveal d1">
        <div class="ic"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-4 10.5c.6.5 1 1.1 1 2v.5h6v-.5c0-.9.4-1.5 1-2A6 6 0 0 0 12 3z"/><path d="M9 20h6M10 22h4"/></svg></div>
        <span class="tag">Education</span><h3>A sharper mind, on their terms</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> A real conversation about what they already love: books, history, the garden, or faith</li>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Someone to tell it to, so what they read and remember has somewhere to go</li>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Gentle scam awareness, and how to verify a caller before trusting them</li>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Never a lesson or a test, always a chat between equals</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar money reveal d2">
        <div class="ic"><svg width="30" height="30" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"><path d="M12 21C6.5 17.4 4 13.5 4 9.6A4.6 4.6 0 0 1 12 6.6 4.6 4.6 0 0 1 20 9.6c0 3.9-2.5 7.8-8 11.4z"/></svg></div>
        <span class="tag">Connection</span><h3>Company, and a legacy kept</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> A warm, patient conversation every single day</li>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Their life stories saved in their own voice, a keepsake for the grandchildren</li>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Faith, gratitude, and treasured memories, whenever your family wants them</li>
          <li><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> The whole family in the loop with a simple daily note</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div></section>


  <section class="week" id="week"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">You are in control</p><h2>You know them best. You choose what they talk about.</h2><p>Set the rhythm and the topics you know they will love. Elderly brings them to life, one call at a time.</p></div>
    <div class="week-grid">
      <div class="day reveal"><span class="dname">Mon</span><span class="chip conn">Connection</span><span class="ex">Their day, the garden, a little music.</span></div>
      <div class="day reveal d1"><span class="dname">Tue</span><span class="chip edu">Education</span><span class="ex">Something new. A bit of history, a puzzle, a fun fact.</span></div>
      <div class="day reveal d2"><span class="dname">Wed</span><span class="chip conn">Connection</span><span class="ex">Stories from the past, saved for the grandchildren.</span></div>
      <div class="day reveal"><span class="dname">Thu</span><span class="chip prev">Prevention</span><span class="ex">A gentle heads up on scams, and a fresh safe word.</span></div>
      <div class="day reveal d1"><span class="dname">Fri</span><span class="chip conn">Connection</span><span class="ex">Hobbies, the grandkids, a light chat.</span></div>
      <div class="day reveal d2"><span class="dname">Sat</span><span class="chip edu">Education</span><span class="ex">Recipes, places, a favorite subject.</span></div>
      <div class="day reveal d3"><span class="dname">Sun</span><span class="chip conn">Connection</span><span class="ex">Faith, gratitude, a hymn, and treasured memories.</span></div>
    </div>
    
  </div></section>

  <section id="agents" class="agents"><div class="wrap">
    <style>
      .agents{background:var(--surface);border-top:1px solid var(--line);}
      .agent-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:40px;}
      .agent-card{background:var(--raise);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:26px 24px;
        display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease,border-color .25s ease;}
      .agent-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 26px 50px -30px rgba(10,30,25,.5);}
      .agent-card .ag-ic{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:13px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:1.5rem;
        background:rgba(29,74,62,.08);}
      .agent-card h3{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.35rem;margin:2px 0 0;color:var(--ink);}
      .agent-card .ag-kick{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:.74rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;
        text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--pine-2);}
      .agent-card p{color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.55;margin:0;}
      .agent-card.feat{border-color:var(--pine);}
      .agent-card.span2{grid-column:span 2;}
      .agent-card.guardian{background:var(--pine);border-color:var(--pine);}
      .agent-card.guardian h3,.agent-card.guardian .ag-ic{color:#F5F0E2;}
      .agent-card.guardian .ag-ic{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);}
      .agent-card.guardian p{color:#D7DED2;}
      .agent-card.guardian .ag-kick{color:var(--amber-2);}
      .ag-foot{margin:30px 0 0;text-align:center;color:var(--ink-soft);font-size:.96rem;}
      .ag-foot a{color:var(--amber);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;}
      @media(max-width:860px){.agent-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}.agent-card.span2{grid-column:auto;}}
      @media(max-width:560px){.agent-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
    </style>
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Choose her agent</p>
      <h2>Every agent is a companion first.</h2>
      <p>The specialty is simply what it listens for. It is the same warm daily call. You choose what it gently keeps an eye on, and the note after each call tells you what it heard.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="agent-grid reveal">
      <article class="agent-card feat">
        <div class="ag-ic">💛</div>
        <p class="ag-kick">In every plan</p>
        <h3>Companionship</h3>
        <p>A warm, friendly call every day for the mom who eats dinner alone. Real company, a gentle check on how she is doing, and the stories of a lifetime saved for her family.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="agent-card">
        <div class="ag-ic">🛡️</div>
        <p class="ag-kick">Add a focus</p>
        <h3>Scam Shield</h3>
        <p>For the mom who answers every call. It listens for anyone asking her for money or a prize, or rushing her, helps her pause, and reminds her of the family safe word.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="agent-card">
        <div class="ag-ic">🩺</div>
        <p class="ag-kick">Add a focus</p>
        <h3>Health Signals</h3>
        <p>For a chronic condition, or after a fall. It gently notices how she slept, whether she is eating, any pain, and if she is taking her medication. Softly, never clinical.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="agent-card">
        <div class="ag-ic">🧠</div>
        <p class="ag-kick">Add a focus</p>
        <h3>Mind &amp; Memory</h3>
        <p>For the first repeated stories. It keeps her mind engaged, and warmly notices if she repeats a story, seems confused, or searches for a word.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="agent-card guardian span2">
        <div class="ag-ic">✨</div>
        <p class="ag-kick">All three, together</p>
        <h3>Guardian</h3>
        <p>For when you cannot choose what to worry about. Scam Shield, Health Signals, and Mind &amp; Memory, all woven into the same daily call.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="ag-foot reveal">You pick her focus when you set up her calls, and you can turn any of them on or off anytime. <a href="#top">Hear a real call word for word</a> in the demo above.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section id="early"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Early access</p><h2>We are opening Elderly to a few families at a time.</h2><p>We are still shaping the plan and the price with our first families, so new accounts are on an early-access list for now. Leave your details and we will reach out to set up the first call.</p></div>
    <div class="ea-card reveal">
      <form id="ea-form" class="ea-form" novalidate>
        <div class="ea-row">
          <label class="ea-field"><span>Your name</span><input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></label>
          <label class="ea-field"><span>Email</span><input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
        </div>
        <div class="ea-row">
          <label class="ea-field"><span>Phone (with country code)</span><input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+1 555 123 4567" required></label>
          <label class="ea-field"><span>Country</span><input name="country" type="text" autocomplete="country-name"></label>
        </div>
        <label class="ea-field"><span>Who is it for?</span><input name="note" type="text" placeholder="My mom and my aunt, both in Rosario"></label>
        <label class="ea-consent"><input type="checkbox" name="consent" required><span>You can contact me about early access and keep my details for that purpose.</span></label>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary ea-submit">Join the early-access list</button>
        <p class="ea-msg" id="ea-msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
      <p class="ea-foot">Already have an account? <a href="/ingresar">Sign in here</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="split"><div class="wrap">
    <img class="reveal" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="A grandfather sharing a warm moment with his granddaughter in the garden">
    <div class="reveal d1">
      <p class="eyebrow">The gift inside the calls</p>
      <h2>Every conversation becomes a memory kept forever.</h2>
      <p>Day by day, Elderly draws out the story of their life, saved in their own voice. So your children and grandchildren grow up with a grandparent they can always hear.</p>
      <p class="quote">The stories you would have lost get saved instead, one ordinary Tuesday call at a time.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="peace">
    <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="An older man laughing warmly with his adult grandson outdoors">
    <div class="veil"></div>
    <div class="wrap reveal">
      <h2>You already give them so much. Elderly watches over the hours in between.</h2>
      <p>It never takes your place. It just means that when you call, you get to be their kid again. Not the nurse, not the accountant, not the one who worries. Just family.</p>
    </div>
  </section>


  <style>
    .ea-card{max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:30px 30px 26px;box-shadow:0 22px 60px -40px rgba(20,40,32,.5)}
    .ea-form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
    .ea-row{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .ea-field{flex:1;min-width:200px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}
    .ea-field>span{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink-soft);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.09em}
    .ea-field input{font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink);background:var(--raise);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;transition:border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}
    .ea-field input:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--pine);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(29,74,62,.12)}
    .ea-consent{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);line-height:1.5;cursor:pointer}
    .ea-consent input{margin-top:2px;width:17px;height:17px;flex-shrink:0;accent-color:var(--pine)}
    .ea-submit{margin-top:4px;width:100%;justify-content:center}
    .ea-msg{margin:2px 0 0;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:14px;min-height:1px}
    .ea-msg.ok{color:var(--pine-2)}
    .ea-msg.err{color:#b3402e}
    .ea-foot{text-align:center;font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:13.5px;color:var(--ink-soft);margin:16px 0 0}
    .ea-foot a{color:var(--pine-2);text-decoration:underline}
  </style>
  <script>
  (function(){
    var API="/api/waitlist";
    var form=document.getElementById("ea-form");
    if(!form) return;
    var msg=document.getElementById("ea-msg");
    form.addEventListener("submit",function(ev){
      ev.preventDefault();
      var data=new FormData(form);
      var consent=form.querySelector('input[name="consent"]');
      if(consent && !consent.checked){ msg.className="ea-msg err"; msg.textContent="Please tick the box so we can contact you."; return; }
      var btn=form.querySelector(".ea-submit"); var label=btn.textContent;
      btn.disabled=true; btn.textContent="Sending...";
      msg.className="ea-msg"; msg.textContent="";
      fetch(API,{method:"POST",headers:{"Content-Type":"application/json"},body:JSON.stringify({
        name:(data.get("name")||"").trim(),
        email:(data.get("email")||"").trim(),
        phone:(data.get("phone")||"").trim(),
        country:(data.get("country")||"").trim(),
        note:(data.get("note")||"").trim(),
        language:"en",
        consent:true
      })}).then(function(r){return r.json().catch(function(){return {};}).then(function(j){return {ok:r.ok,j:j};});})
      .then(function(res){
        btn.textContent=label; btn.disabled=false;
        if(res.ok){ form.reset(); msg.className="ea-msg ok"; msg.textContent="You are on the list. We will be in touch soon to set up the first call."; }
        else { msg.className="ea-msg err"; msg.textContent=(res.j&&res.j.detail)?res.j.detail:"Something went wrong. Please try again."; }
      }).catch(function(){ btn.textContent=label; btn.disabled=false; msg.className="ea-msg err"; msg.textContent="Network error. Please try again."; });
    });
  })();
  </script>

  <section id="faq" style="background:var(--surface);border-top:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:32px;"><p class="eyebrow">Good questions</p><h2>The things families ask first.</h2></div>
    <div class="faq reveal">
      <details open><summary>Does my parent need a smartphone or the internet? <span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>No. Elderly calls the regular telephone they already use, landline or cell. Nothing to download, charge, or learn. If they can answer the phone, they can use it.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Would Mom or Dad really talk to an AI? <span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>Almost everyone warms up within the first few seconds. The call feels like a natural, unhurried chat with someone genuinely interested, and Elderly always says who it is. No pressure, no rush.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Does this replace my own calls and visits? <span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>Never. It is an extra layer for the hours you cannot be there, so your own calls can be about love, not logistics. You stay their family, we just make sure nothing slips through in between.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How does the scam protection work? <span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>Elderly talks with them every day, so it is the first to notice when a new friend starts asking for money, and it tells you that day. It also keeps your family safe word fresh, so a cloned voice cannot fool them.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What language does it speak? <span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>English, warm and patient.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Who can see the stories and reports? <span class="pm">+</span></summary><p>Only the family members you invite. Everything is private by default and belongs to your family, to keep, download, or turn into a book whenever you like.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="blogt" id="blog"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">From our blog</p><h2>The research behind the daily call.</h2><p>Real numbers on loneliness, fraud, and family, and what actually helps.</p></div>
    <div class="cards">
      <a class="bcard c1 reveal" href="/blog/loneliness"><div class="top"></div><div class="bd"><span class="cat">Loneliness</span><h3>Why isolation raises dementia risk by 50%</h3><p>What the U.S. Surgeon General found about loneliness in older adults, and why a daily call helps.</p><span class="read">Read the article</span></div></a>
      <a class="bcard c2 reveal d1" href="/blog/elder-fraud"><div class="top"></div><div class="bd"><span class="cat">Scams</span><h3>$4.9 billion lost, and the new voice-clone threat</h3><p>The FBI's 2024 elder fraud numbers, and how a family safe word fights back.</p><span class="read">Read the article</span></div></a>
      <a class="bcard c3 reveal d2" href="/blog/why-daily-call"><div class="top"></div><div class="bd"><span class="cat">Family</span><h3>Why they will not tell you, but they will tell the call</h3><p>The quiet reason a daily check in catches what a weekly phone call misses.</p><span class="read">Read the article</span></div></a>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:28px;"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/blog">See all articles</a></div>
  </div></section>
</main>


